            "value": "<p><em>Applied by <strong>Cult Sign</strong> to each affected ally.</em></p>\n<hr />\n<p>The target is marked with your patron's sigil, with no save. You and any ally who can see the sigil gain a +1 circumstance bonus to attack rolls and to Rite spell attack rolls against the marked creature. You always know the direction and rough distance to a creature carrying your sigil, even out of sight. Only one creature may carry your sigil at a time.</p>"
